--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The bundle format defined in SPEC.md adopts, without modification, two
specifications developed elsewhere:

  * the Dead Simple Signing Envelope (DSSE), from the Secure Systems Lab
    https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse

  * the in-toto Attestation Framework Statement v1
    https://github.com/in-toto/attestation

Whence defines only its own predicate type. No code from either project is
included or vendored here; the envelope and statement are constructed from
their published specifications.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All data in data/ is synthetic and was produced by data/_generate.py.
Halloway Instruments is a fictional company. The SKUs, prices, order records,
FX rates, journal entries and people named in those files are invented and do
not correspond to any real company, product, customer, transaction or person.
